    "detailed_description": "<strong>Vikings Hnefatafl: Kings of the Dark Age</strong> is a historical turn-based strategy game, based on the ancient <i>hnefatafl</i> board game played by Vikings.<br><br>The game itself has a very simple structure, albeit having been slightly altered from its original medieval form into a more computer game-esque format. The idea is to kill the enemy King, while simultaneously protecting your own at all costs. Compose your army, chart the map, and move wisely.<br><br>The game is set at the onset of the Viking invasions of Britain in the early Middle Ages. The Campaign follows the advance of the Vikings into the Anglo-Saxon kingdoms, facing powerful kings such as the legendary Alfred the Great.<br><br>You will be leading either the Vikings or the Saxons into victory - or defeat - in this highly tactical yet calmly paced strategy game where every move counts.<br><br><u>FEATURES</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Single-player Campaign and Custom Battles against Computer<br></li><li>Two-player Custom Battles in hotseat, or online over Remote Play<br></li><li>Highly customizable: choose board size, personal banner, Computer difficulty, etc.<br></li><li>A massive number of Custom maps (board types) generated for both Small and Large sizes<br></li><li>Large list of different types of game pieces, or ''units'' each with their own strengths or weaknesses<br></li><li>Different terrain types affect gameplay</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Vikings Hnefatafl: Kings of the Dark Age</strong> is a historical turn-based strategy game, based on the ancient <i>hnefatafl</i> board game played by Vikings.<br><br>The game itself has a very simple structure, albeit having been slightly altered from its original medieval form into a more computer game-esque format. The idea is to kill the enemy King, while simultaneously protecting your own at all costs. Compose your army, chart the map, and move wisely.<br><br>The game is set at the onset of the Viking invasions of Britain in the early Middle Ages. The Campaign follows the advance of the Vikings into the Anglo-Saxon kingdoms, facing powerful kings such as the legendary Alfred the Great.<br><br>You will be leading either the Vikings or the Saxons into victory - or defeat - in this highly tactical yet calmly paced strategy game where every move counts.<br><br><u>FEATURES</u><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Single-player Campaign and Custom Battles against Computer<br></li><li>Two-player Custom Battles in hotseat, or online over Remote Play<br></li><li>Highly customizable: choose board size, personal banner, Computer difficulty, etc.<br></li><li>A massive number of Custom maps (board types) generated for both Small and Large sizes<br></li><li>Large list of different types of game pieces, or ''units'' each with their own strengths or weaknesses<br></li><li>Different terrain types affect gameplay</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In the late 8th century, Anglo-Saxon Britain faces a threat like none before: northmen from across the seas, also called Vikings. In Vikings Hnefatafl: Kings of the Dark Age, you will be leading either the Vikings or the Saxons into battle by means of turn-based strategy.",
